DTSTART:20261029T020000Z
DTEND:20261029T035500Z
DTSTAMP:20261029T020000Z
UID:xjH1X2fX3Z
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nPresented by Seattle 48 Hour 
 Film Project\, CREATE48 Media Network\, and Harbor Island Studios. See wh
 at happens when local filmmakers have just 48 hours to bring their night
 mares to life. The Seattle 48 Hour Horror Film Project presents a wildly
  inventive collection of short horror films\, celebrating homegrown talent
 \, unexpected scares\, and filmmaking under pressure.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-48-hour-horror-film-project-2026\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
