  his genius and his voracious\, even self-destructive\, appetite for music
  and for life.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/bernsteins-wall
 \n\nEstimated start: 14:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
