DTEND:20261025T205500Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T190000Z
UID:sNrbDratrG
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nFollowing the death of his father
  (Josh Brolin)\, Jay Gardiner (Austin Abrams) goes diving off the central 
 Coast of California in search of his remains\, but is swallowed by a massi
 ve sperm whale. While trapped inside its belly with only one hour of oxyge
 n left\, Jay comes to realize that the hard-earned lessons his father impa
 rted may be the key to his escape.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theat
 ers/whalefall\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
