BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS (1971)
DTSTART:20261027T021500Z
DTEND:20261027T042500Z
DTSTAMP:20261027T021500Z
UID:ASeClUFTrP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 114 mins (1h54m)\n\nAn enduring masterpiece of cinem
 a starring Oliver Reed and Vanessa Redgrave\, KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS i
 s a prescient epic of obsession and corruption –and a defining work of a
 rt from seminal filmmaker Ken Russell. KEN RUSSELL’S THE DEVILS is the u
 ncut and unfiltered theatrical experience that Russell always envisioned 
 – and the first time the film will be presented restored and in 4K.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/ken-russells-the-devils\n\nEstimate
 d start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gorky Resort
DTSTART:20261025T210000Z
DTEND:20261025T231000Z
DTSTAMP:20261025T210000Z
UID:NRaGJITOCs
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nThe Seattle Polish Film Festival
  presents the film Gorky Resort. In 1939\, as war descends on Europe\, th
 ousands of Polish citizens are taken captive by the Soviet Union and subje
 cted to relentless ideological indoctrination. An ambitious Soviet agent s
 ets out to break the spirit of a young\, world-renowned pianist and leader
  among the prisoners\, believing that his surrender could force others to 
 follow.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-polish-film-fes
 tival-2026/gorky-resort\n\nEstimated start: 14:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
