 g man makes a series of radical choices to get himself out of debt without
  telling his girlfriend-practically fiancée that he’s going to be homel
 ess. Director Mark Alan Hoffman and author Evan P. Schneider scheduled to
  attend\, with post-film Q&A moderated by film critic Mike Ward (Should I 
 See It).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics-
